    "Use a single #pragma omp parallel region around the entire time-stepping loop with default(none) and explicit sharing of arrays and nbodies",
    "Apply schedule(static) on both force-computation workshare and position-update workshare for minimal overhead",
    "Add #pragma omp simd reduction(+:fx,fy,fz) aligned(x,y,z:32) on inner force loop to enable vectorization with alignment hints",
